Licences for packages in the dependency tree of interactive/vendor/Recharts.js
(Recharts 2.15.4 UMD build).

Version provenance. The versions below are the resolved versions in the upstream
Recharts v2.15.4 package-lock.json (github.com/recharts/recharts, tag v2.15.4,
fetched 2026-11-14), plus victory-vendor 36.9.1 which supplies the d3 modules
(MIT AND ISC; the d3 modules and internmap are ISC). The UMD bundle is minified
and carries no package manifest, so this project could not independently confirm
byte-for-byte which of these packages, at which versions, are inlined. Treat the
list as the upstream-declared tree, not as a verified inventory of the bundle.
Licence texts were fetched from unpkg.com at those versions on 2026-11-14.
The upstream notice Recharts.js.LICENSE.txt is shipped beside this file; the
Recharts licence itself is recharts.LICENSE. The embedded Modernizr notice in
react-dom.production.min.js is covered at the end.


